	(text "DEV PORT, page 2 of 3: FT2232HL on hub port DN3. Channel A = P4 UART0 (console), channel B = C5 UART0.\nDTR/RTS -> MMBT3904 pairs = esptool auto-reset on P4_EN/BOOT (GPIO35) and C5_EN/C5_BOOT. C5_EN reaches the C5\nCHIP_PU through R606 (330R) onto module pad 82 (P4 GPIO54 net): P4 firmware drives GPIO54 open-drain.\nNo back-powering: Dev->target TX through open-drain 74LVC1G07 (target pull-ups R1707/R1708),\ntarget->Dev TX through 74LVC1G125 (Ioff inputs). 93LC56B: optional FTDI config EEPROM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
